[5697]="70051129\n1\tPick ripe gourds (total: 10)\tThe Wistmead wheat maze can be found in the Wistmead Harvest Festival space. Ermentrude Haybank has tasked you with gathering decorative gourds.\n2\tBring the gourds to Ermentrude Haybank\tThe Wistmead wheat maze can be found in the Wistmead Harvest Festival space. You should bring the gourds to Ermentrude Haybank at the wheat maze entrance.\n",
[5698]="7001BA6D\n1\tCollect grave-moss (total: 15)\tHaudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham, and Haudh Nogbenn are located in the southern Barrow-downs. Agatha Greendale has asked you to collect a rare grave-moss that can be found on several creatures that inhabit Haudh Iarchith.\n2\tBring the grave-moss to Agatha Greendale in Bree\tAgatha Greendale can be found at the end of the Haunted Alley, near the Hunting Lodge, in Bree-town. You should bring the grave-moss to Agatha Greendale.\n",
[5699]="7006EC6E\n1\tCaptain Khâtaphos has made a list of places he would like someone to visit and promote Furtherholm. You should pick a location to go to.\t\n2\tTalk to Khâtaphos in Furtherholm\tAt Khâtaphos' request, you have gone to a location on his list and successfully promoted Furtherholm. You should return to him inside The Cracked Flagon to claim your reward.\n",
[5700]="7006EC6D\n1\tComplete Gathering Guests (total: 7)\tComplete the quest Gathering Guests (Daily) seven times during the Midsummer Festival.\n",
[5701]="7006EC7E\n1\tFind potential visitors in Bree-town\tYou have been tasked with travelling to Bree and finding a potential visitor who might accept an invitation to visit Furtherholm for the Midsummer Festival. You should look around Bree-town for potential visitors.\n2\tInvite someone to visit Furtherholm\tYou have found potential visitors in Bree. You should choose one who is most likely to accept an invitation to visit Furtherholm for the Midsummer Festival and invite them. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
