[5715]="700620E4\n1\tCollect hawkwort flowers (total: 6)\030Collect lavender flowers (total: 2)\tTangwen has asked you to bring her flower heads from the fields around Herne and lavender from her garden in Herne. Herne is in western Cardolan.\n2\tReturn to Tangwen\tYou should bring the hawkwort flowers and lavender to Tangwen. Tangwen is in Herne, in western Cardolan.\n3\tBrew the tea in the teapot\tTangwen has asked you to add the herbs to the teapot to create a relaxing tea of the people of Herne. The teapot is on the table next to Tangwen, in Herne's Inn.\n4\tTalk to Tangwen\tYou have helped Tangwen make a herbal tea, and now she is waiting to speak with you. Tangwen is in Herne in Cardolan.\n",
[5716]="70025E70\n1\tCollect grapes (total: 6)\tThe vineyard is north of Rosa Brockhouse on Northcotton Farm. Rosa Brockhouse asked you to help her make jam for her pies. The first step is to gather grapes.\n2\tThe crushing tubs are next to the vineyard at the Northcotton Farm. The grapes need to be crushed in the tubs before they can be turned into jam.\t\n3\tDance on the grapes to crush them\030Stand in the tub\tYou were told that by dancing on the grapes in the tubs, you could crush them effectively. The grapes are in tubs by the vineyard. The next step is to crush them.\n4\tCollect the crushed grapes from the tub\tThe crushed grapes need to be collected from the tub.\n5\tBring the crushed grapes to Theobald Longfurrow\tTheobald Longfurrow is next to the vineyards on Northcotton Farm. Theobald Longfurrow will help you turn your crushed grapes into jam.\n6\tBring the jam to Rosa Brockhouse\tRosa Brockhouse is south of the vineyards on the Northcotton Farm. Rosa Brockhouse will want to get the jam put into the pie.\n",
[5717]="7006B6C7\n1\tCollect logs (total: 6)\tNingêna has asked you to collect logs and deposit them in a pile near the archers' towers at Sûru.\n2\tPlace the logs in the pile at the building site\tYou have collected the logs. You should deposit them in a pile near the archers' towers at Sûru.\n3\tTalk to Ningêna\tYou have placed the logs you collected at the building site. You should return to Ningêna.\n",
[5718]="7006BCB3\n1\tFind the location of the magical sand to the south-east\tReach the locations where you can find magical sand for Angârmu's enchantment to the south-east near the river.\n2\tGather sand (total: 3)\tGather handfuls of magical sand for Angârmu's enchantment at the location you found to the south-east near the river.\n3\tFind the location of the magical sand to the north-east\tReach the location where you can find magical sand for Angârmu's enchantment to the north-east along the river.\n4\tGather sand (total: 3)\tGather handfuls of magical sand for Angârmu's enchantment at the location you found to the north-east along the river's edge.\n5\tFind the location of the magical sand to the north-east\tReach the location where you can find magical sand for Angârmu's enchantment further to the north-east along the river.\n6\tGather sand (total: 3)\tGather handfuls of magical sand for Angârmu's enchantment at the location you found further to the north near the river's edge.\n7\tReturned to Angârmu with the gathered sand\tReturn to Angârmu in Malgâma near Zikrum-dûl with the piles of gathered sand to complete their enchantment.\n",
[5719]="7006B677\n1\tLook in likely spots for oysters (total: 4)\tZildug has invited you to gather oysters for him. Oysters can be harvested in the shallows west of Iridír.\n2\tBring the oysters to Zildug in Iridír\tYou have gathered oysters from the Ikorbân River shallows. You should bring them to Zildug in Iridír.\n",
[5720]="700173BB\n1\tBring the plans to Úlfur at Anazârmekhem\030Collect assault plans (total: 8)\tFil Gashan lies to the south-west of Anazârmekhem. Úlfur told you that he is trying to devise a counter to the offensive the Orcs have planned against Lothlórien, but he needs more information to create an effective one. He asked you to search through Fil Gashan for any signs of the Orcs' plans.\n",
[5721]="7006C6F8\n1\tLook over the lands east of Dûl Zidur for signs of invasion\030Look over the lands south of Dûl Zidur for signs of invasion\030Look over the lands west of Dûl Zidur for signs of invasion\030Look over the lands north of Dûl Zidur for signs of invasion\tAshâmi and Raphûz, unnerved by the words of the cultist, want to collect evidence of a greater threat to present to Numûru. They ask you to search near Dûl Zidur, where the cultists are most numerous to search in all directions for signs of invasion.\n2\tPresent your findings to Raphûz at his home in Urmâkh\tNear Dûl Zidur and the Bridge of Princes you saw an encampment of Orcs to the north. Among the Orcs, stood one of proportions more fitting of a troll: fearsome, vile, and terrifying. Return this information to Raphûz and Ashâmi at their home in Urmâkh.\n3\tPresent the evidence to Numûru at his post in Urmâkh\tHaving heard your report and deciphered the letter they discovered, Ashâmi and Raphûz send you to present the evidence to Numûru at his post in Urmâkh.\n4\tSpeak with Ashâmi at her home in Urmâkh\tNumûru refuses to look to other threats while the Ordâkhai remain. He will not bring the information to Mizâdi. Speak with Ashâmi or Raphûz at their home in Urmâkh and ask how they want to proceed.\n",
[5722]="7005943B\n1\tGather sap from tree tappers in the Wildwood (total: 10)\tTree tappers can be found in the Wildwood. You should gather sap from the tree tappers in the Wildwood.\n2\tReturn to Cad Buckthorn with the sap you have collected\tCad Buckthorn can be found in Trestlebridge. You should return to Cad Buckthorn with the sap you have collected.\n",
[5723]="70027105\n1\tTalk to Tecwin in Durgors\030Collect pieces of driftwood (total: 8)\tDriftwood can be found along the banks of the river. Tecwin has asked you to gather up driftwood to use for oars.\n",
[5724]="7005A537\n1\tCollect twistbeard moss (total: 10)\tTwistbeard can found on rocks in Azanulbizar. Edash has tasked you with gathering twistbeard moss.\n2\tReturn to Edash\tEdash is located in Amdân. Bring the healing moss to Edash.\n",
[5725]="70045258\n1\tGather sheep from the north of Erelas (total: 4)\tYou should gather the sheep on the hills due north of Erelas in the Beacon Hills.\n2\tLead the sheep to safety\tYou should lead the first flock of sheep back to Ost Rimmon.\n3\tGather sheep from the slope of Calenhad (total: 4)\tYou should gather the sheep from the north-eastern slope of Calenhad in the Beacon Hills.\n4\tLead the sheep to safety\tYou should lead the second flock of sheep back to Ost Rimmon.\n5\tGather sheep west of Bâr Nadhron (total: 4)\tYou should gather the sheep west of Bâr Nadhron in the Beacon Hills.\n6\tLead the sheep to safety\tYou should lead the third flock of sheep back to Ost Rimmon.\n7\tReturn to Lavandir\tNow that you have led the flocks of sheep to safety, you should return to Lavandir in Ost Rimmon.\n",
[5726]="7003313A\n1\tThe Cross-roads of Ash can be found by following the road west from Durin's Court. Gúthi's score-marks can be found along the way. You should keep an eye out for Gúthi's score marks on the walls, which should help to guide you along the path to the Cross-roads of Ash.\t\n2\tSpeak with Gúthi at The Cross-roads of Ash\tGúthi is at The Cross-roads of Ash, in the south-west quadrant of the Flaming Deeps. You should speak with Gúthi.\n",
[5727]="70026095\n1\tGather up the chickens (total: 4)\tChickens can be found around the animal pens on Northcotton Farm. Gerard Deephole asked you to gather up the chickens around the farm.\n2\tTalk to Gerard Deephole\tGerard Deephole is at the animal pens on Northcotton Farm. Gerard Deephole will be pleased to hear the chickens have all been caught.\n",
[5728]="7001BA15\n1\tGather barrow-shards (total: 10)\tHaudh Methernil, The Barrow of Ringdor, The Barrow of Taradan, Hautham, and Haudh Taenthond are scattered across the northern Barrow-downs. Broderic Willowmeade has asked you to travel to Haudh Methernil, The Barrow of Ringdor, The Barrow of Taradan, Hautham, and Haudh Taenthond and gather barrow-shards from the various creatures that patrol the halls.\n2\tBring the barrow-shards to Broderic Willowmeade\tBroderic Willowmeade is at the Bree Hunting Lodge in Bree-town, east of the Barrow-downs. You should bring the barrow-shards you recovered to Broderic Willowmeade.\n",
})
